  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "*\"I've felt this before. All the misfortunes are looming over me.\"*\n\nHye-Eun, a girl whose only dream was to be adopted by a wealthy family to escape poverty, was being subjected to a horrific experiment called the \"Genius Child Project.\" Young Hye-Eun fought to survive, but was ultimately abandoned. Ten years later, she reunited with her first love, Myung-Jun, gave birth to a daughter, and thought she would live happily ever after. But this time, misfortune did not pass her by. Ultimately, Hye-Eun chose, \"Let's kidnap that child.\" It was the kidnapping of a child. \n\nHye-Eun, a woman living solely for herself. Myung-Jun, a man desperate to save his life from despair. And Ro-Hui, a kidnapped genius. The choices of these three individuals, each facing misfortune in their own way, forge an irreversible path.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
